<!DOCTYPE html>

<html dir="rtl" lang="ar"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><title>المقاولات العامة للمباني | لمسات الإبداع</title>
<style>
:root{--navy:#12384d;--gold:#b79560;--ink:#273943;--muted:#61717b;--surface:#f3f6f7}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#e9eef0;color:var(--ink);font-family:"Noto Sans Arabic","IBM Plex Sans Arabic","Segoe UI",Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
.page{max-width:760px;margin:auto;background:white;min-height:100vh;box-shadow:0 8px 40px #12384d15}
header{padding:18px 6%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:#fff}
.brand{font-weight:800;font-size:20px;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.4}.brand small{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;direction:ltr;text-align:right;letter-spacing:1px;color:#9c7d53}
.menu{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #e3e8eb;border-radius:9px;width:39px;height:39px;font-size:22px;color:var(--navy)}
.hero{padding:38px 6% 40px;background:var(--navy);color:white}
.kicker{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#dcc6a6;letter-spacing:.5px}
h1{font-size:clamp(27px,4.7vw,37px);line-height:1.65;font-weight:800;margin:13px 0 16px;letter-spacing:-.45px}
.hero p{font-size:clamp(15px,2.4vw,17px);line-height:2.15;max-width:660px;margin:0;color:#e8eff2;font-weight:400}
.hero strong{color:white;font-weight:750}
.work{padding:30px 6% 35px}
.section-eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px}
h2{color:var(--navy);font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;margin:7px 0 7px;font-weight:800}
.intro{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.95;margin:0 0 19px}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
.gallery figure{margin:0;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid #e6ebed;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
.gallery figure img{display:block;width:100%;height:190px;object-fit:contain;background:#f5f6f7}
.gallery figure:first-child,.gallery figure:nth-child(2){grid-column:1/-1}.gallery figure:first-child img{height:auto;max-height:370px}
.gallery figure:nth-child(2) img{height:auto;max-height:340px}.gallery figure:nth-child(n+3) img{height:195px;object-fit:cover}
.action{background:var(--surface);padding:27px 6% 36px;text-align:center}
.action p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 17px}
.action a{background:var(--navy);display:inline-block;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:11px;padding:13px 25px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700}
footer{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#819099;padding:19px 10px}
@media(max-width:480px){header{padding:14px 18px}.brand{font-size:17px}.hero{padding:30px 22px 32px}.kicker{font-size:11px}h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.55}.hero p{font-size:15px;line-height:2.08}.work{padding:26px 18px 30px}.gallery{gap:9px}.gallery figure img{height:148px}.gallery figure:first-child img{max-height:270px}.gallery figure:nth-child(n+3) img{height:145px}.intro{font-size:14px}.action{padding:25px 22px 30px}}
.gallery.gallery-four{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;align-items:stretch}
.gallery.gallery-four figure,
.gallery.gallery-four figure:first-child,
.gallery.gallery-four figure:nth-child(2){grid-column:auto;min-width:0;aspect-ratio:4/3;margin:0}
.gallery.gallery-four figure img,
.gallery.gallery-four figure:first-child img,
.gallery.gallery-four figure:nth-child(2) img,
.gallery.gallery-four figure:nth-child(n+3) img{width:100%;height:100%;max-height:none;object-fit:cover;display:block}
</style></head><body><main class="page">
<header><div class="brand">لمسات الإبداع<small>CREATIVITY TOUCHES FOR CONTRACTING</small></div><span aria-label="القائمة" class="menu">☰</span></header>
